  m_Text: '<b>House 4: Mechanics Shop (0/10)</b>

    <color=#FFCC44>[TODO]</color>
    1. [SCRIPT] Open Workshop Garage Door

    <color=#FFCC44>[TODO]</color> 2. [SCRIPT]
    Slide Toolbox Drawer open

    <color=#FFCC44>[TODO]</color> 3. [GRAB] Grab Screw
    Driver from Drawer

    <color=#FFCC44>[TODO]</color> 4. Touch Screw Driver to
    Car Body (Screw sound)

    <color=#FFCC44>[TODO]</color> 5. [GRAB] Grab Wrench
    from Drawer

    <color=#FFCC44>[TODO]</color> 6. Use Wrench on Wheel Bolt

    <color=#FFCC44>[TODO]</color>
    7. [GRAB] Stack Tires / Mount Rim in Tire

    <color=#FFCC44>[TODO]</color>
    8. [GRAB] Stack Rims on top of each other

    <color=#FFCC44>[TODO]</color>
    9. [UI] Press Test Horn button (Honk)

    <color=#FFCC44>[TODO]</color> 10.
    [UI] Press Test Engine button (Engine sound)

'
