  m_Text: '<b>House 5: The Backrooms (0/10)</b>

    <color=#FFCC44>[TODO]</color>
    1. Open Front Door of Backrooms House

    <color=#FFCC44>[TODO]</color> 2. [SCRIPT/TELEPORT]
    Step through Doorway Noclip

    <color=#FFCC44>[TODO]</color> 3. [GRAB] Grab
    Flash Light from floor

    <color=#FFCC44>[TODO]</color> 4. [UI] Press Flash
    Light Toggle Switch

    <color=#FFCC44>[TODO]</color> 5. [GRAB] Place Almond
    Water onto Desk

    <color=#FFCC44>[TODO]</color> 6. [SCRIPT] Drink 5 Almond
    Waters to teleport out

    <color=#FFCC44>[TODO]</color> 7. [SCRIPT] Slide Desk
    Drawer open

    <color=#FFCC44>[TODO]</color> 8. [SCRIPT] Ceiling Light flickers
    and buzzes

    <color=#FFCC44>[TODO]</color> 9. [SCRIPT] Monster chases in Line
    of Sight

    <color=#FFCC44>[TODO]</color> 10. [SCRIPT] Monster touches -> Jumpscare

'
